"The slime Syl, taken there as Sylvain, broke the dome with acid and bombs from within."
"Syl killed the mermen king with stored lightning and absorbed the lightning-casting queen."
"Syl carried off many Azulean treasures and used them to build Tanglebay's outposts."
"The siren Amelia and her human Lewis tried to frame Sylvain in Azulean; Syl killed both."
